        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Nicolas is by far the most effective massage therapist I have seen.  Over the years, I have seen dozens of massage therapists hoping to obtain actual relief from my pain.  Nicolas was able to diagnose my problem areas within minutes and provided treatment with amazing results.  Nicolas is professional, he listens, and provides the level of care I have been looking for for a very long time.  Within the first session, I felt trust with Nicolas.  You can see that he cares for his clients and loves his job.  I will never see another massage therapist.  He is truly the best.",
        "time": 1676672442,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Penny Paris",
