        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Nicolas understands what it means to be active and knows how to get you back out there enjoying your favourite activities. Within the hour, I went from not being able to fully rotate my upper body to full range of motion. I highly recommend him!",
